 3. ``dump(obj, many)`` (serialization)
-4. ``@post_dump(pass_many=False)`` methods
-5. ``@post_dump(pass_many=True)`` methods
+4. ``@post_dump(pass_collection=False)`` methods
+5. ``@post_dump(pass_collection=True)`` methods
 
 
